<title>POLAND: RELPOL NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
